This project has a graphify knowledge graph at graphify-out/.

- Before answering architecture or codebase questions, read graphify-out/GRAPH_REPORT.md for god nodes and community structure
- Prefer navigating graphify-out/obsidian/ (Obsidian vault) for node-level detail — open that folder as a vault in Obsidian, or follow [[wikilinks]] from GRAPH_REPORT.md community hubs
- If graphify-out/wiki/index.md exists, use it as an agent-crawlable alternative to raw files
- After modifying code files in this session, run `graphify update .` to keep the graph current (AST-only, no API cost); rerun `python scripts/build-graphify.py` to refresh the Obsidian vault
